WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:04.200
Hello, everyone. We just wrapped up
the Ghana-Chicago Business Roundtable

00:04.200 --> 00:07.280
right here on the West Side, the best side,

00:07.280 --> 00:11.880
with His Excellency Victor-
Ambassador Victor Smith.

00:12.360 --> 00:16.840
And I want to say that I was,
blown away

00:16.840 --> 00:20.920
by the information that was given,
and also the vision that he has

00:20.920 --> 00:25.480
for the nation that lines up with
President Mahama's vision as well.

00:25.480 --> 00:29.080
Talking about AI, manufacturing,
they didn't mention real estate,

00:29.080 --> 00:33.240
but they did talk about fintech,
the financial, sector,

00:33.240 --> 00:36.560
because there's other things
to invest in Ghana,

00:36.560 --> 00:38.280
outside of real estate as well.

00:38.280 --> 00:41.120
But if you want real estate,
we got you on that, too.

00:41.120 --> 00:44.160
But thank you so much
for coming to Chicago,

00:44.160 --> 00:48.360
opening up the door and the opportunity
for this initiative,

00:48.360 --> 00:52.880
and I am grateful to be number four,
the number four- well,

00:52.880 --> 00:56.520
number four in terms of membership
for Region 17.
